          "filename": "Moola Chotuk, Khuzdar, Balochistan.jpg",
          "caption": "Moola Chotuk Hidden paradise in Balochistan More than 80 km away from Khuzdar there is a beautiful village called Moola, It is a Tehsil of District Khuzdar. It is famous due to historical place as well as its geographical location.\nIn this village many waterfalls are found, Chotok is one of the biggest waterfalls of Sub Tehsil Moola as well as Baluchistan. This waterfall exist between two hills, the peaks of the hills are interacted with each other that is why waterfall just looks like an umbrella.\n\nIts water is hot during winter season and cold during summer season, people feel pleasant and find themselves in the imaginative world.",
          "alt": "Moola Chotuk Hidden paradise in Balochistan More than 80 km away from Khuzdar there is a beautiful village called Moola, It is a Tehsil of District Khuzdar. It is famous due to historical place as well as its geographical location.\nIn this village many waterfalls are found, Chotok is one of the biggest waterfalls of Sub Tehsil Moola as well as Baluchistan. This waterfall exist between two hills, the peaks of the hills are interacted with each other that is why waterfall just looks like an umbrella.\n\nIts water is hot during winter season and cold during summer season, people feel pleasant and find themselves in the imaginative world.",
